        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Directed Audience",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You can shape the area of your composition spells. Whenever you cast a composition spell whose area is an emanation, you can change the spell's area to a cone 10 feet larger, to a maximum of twice the original area. For example, you could modify a composition spell that affects a @Template[emanation|distance:30] to affect a @Template[cone|distance:40], but a @Template[emanation|distance:5] could only become a @Template[cone|distance:10].</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 2
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "bard"
            ]
          }
        },
